    <briefdescription>
<para>Binary gap payoff. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This payoff is equivalent to being a) long a PlainVanillaPayoff at the first strike (same Call/Put type) and b) short a CashOrNothingPayoff at the first strike (same Call/Put type) with cash payoff equal to the difference between the second and the first strike. <xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000059"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>this payoff can be negative depending on the strikes </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
